  "updated_at": "2026-04-09",
  "bio": "Taj Mirage is a highly skilled tattoo artist specialized in the intricate designs of floral and geometric styles. Operating out of Xclusive Ink in Rocky Hill, United States, Taj prides themselves on delivering clean, precise tattoos that transform skin into a canvas of magical body art. Stepping into their studio, @mirage_magic, clients can expect a fusion of professionalism and a visually enchanting experience that reflects Taj’s dedication to their craft.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Rocky Hill, Connecticut, United States"
}